@guide H_Terokkar
@name Terokkar Forest (Stonebreaker Hold)
@faction Horde
@levels 63-65
@zone Terokkar Forest
@chapter Outland
@desc Shattrath City (choose Aldor or Scryers), Stonebreaker Hold, Cenarion Thicket, Firewing Point and the Bone Wastes.
@next H_Nagrand

accept A'dal [optional] | Leads you to A'dal in Shattrath.
turnin A'dal [optional]
fp Shattrath City
note In Shattrath, pick the Aldor or the Scryers. Either is fine for leveling.
accept Arakkoa War Path | Advisor Faila, Stonebreaker Hold.
accept An Unwelcome Presence | Kurgatok.
accept Magical Disturbances
accept Vestments of the Wolf Spirit | Malukaz.
accept Stymying the Arakkoa | Rokag.
accept Olemba Seed Oil | Rakoria.
accept What Happens in Terokkar Stays in Terokkar | Shadowstalker Kaide.
accept Speak with Scout Neftis
accept Wanted: Bonelashers Dead!
fp Stonebreaker Hold
bind Stonebreaker Hold
complete Arakkoa War Path
complete An Unwelcome Presence
complete Magical Disturbances
complete Vestments of the Wolf Spirit
complete Stymying the Arakkoa
complete Olemba Seed Oil
complete What Happens in Terokkar Stays in Terokkar
turnin Arakkoa War Path
turnin An Unwelcome Presence
accept The Firewing Liaison
turnin Magical Disturbances
turnin Vestments of the Wolf Spirit
accept Patriarch Ironjaw
turnin Stymying the Arakkoa
turnin Olemba Seed Oil
accept And Now, the Moment of Truth
turnin What Happens in Terokkar Stays in Terokkar
turnin Speak with Scout Neftis
accept Who Are They?
complete Who Are They?
turnin Who Are They?
accept Kill the Shadow Council!
complete Kill the Shadow Council!
turnin Kill the Shadow Council!
complete The Firewing Liaison
complete Patriarch Ironjaw
complete And Now, the Moment of Truth
complete Wanted: Bonelashers Dead!
turnin The Firewing Liaison
turnin Patriarch Ironjaw
accept Welcoming the Wolf Spirit
turnin And Now, the Moment of Truth
turnin Wanted: Bonelashers Dead!
accept Torgos! [group=2; optional]
turnin Welcoming the Wolf Spirit
accept 9960 What's Wrong at Cenarion Thicket? | Tooki.
turnin 9960 What's Wrong at Cenarion Thicket? | Earthbinder Tavgren, Cenarion Thicket.
accept Strange Energy
accept Clues in the Thicket
complete Strange Energy
complete Clues in the Thicket
turnin Strange Energy
turnin Clues in the Thicket
accept By Any Means Necessary
turnin By Any Means Necessary
accept Wind Trader Lathrai
turnin Wind Trader Lathrai
accept A Personal Favor
complete A Personal Favor
turnin A Personal Favor
accept Investigate Tuurem
turnin Investigate Tuurem
accept What Are These Things?
turnin What Are These Things?
accept Report to Stonebreaker Camp
turnin Report to Stonebreaker Camp
accept Attack on Firewing Point
complete Attack on Firewing Point
turnin Attack on Firewing Point
accept The Final Code
complete The Final Code
turnin The Final Code
accept Letting Earthbinder Tavgren Know
turnin Letting Earthbinder Tavgren Know
accept An Improper Burial | Commander Ra'vaj, Sha'tari Base Camp.
complete An Improper Burial
turnin An Improper Burial
accept A Hero Is Needed
complete A Hero Is Needed
turnin A Hero Is Needed
accept The Fallen Exarch
complete The Fallen Exarch
turnin The Fallen Exarch
accept For the Fallen
complete For the Fallen
turnin For the Fallen
accept Terokkarantula
complete Terokkarantula [group=2]
turnin Terokkarantula
level 65
note Ride west from Shattrath into Nagrand; Garadar is the Horde town in the north.
